    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are given two pairs of pentominoes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/d64d5e6f79b766e36e6ce2abcda89c4e.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/d64d5e6f79b766e36e6ce2abcda89c4e.webp?t=1755615032\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=199 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine them into two shapes that have the same outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/7d43c5d674833c6fdde883dfec6efbb6.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/7d43c5d674833c6fdde883dfec6efbb6.webm?t=1755615032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">For an extra challenge, there's an option to hide the outline until you find it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/3831cc6d92e2e39dad87b419cb221cc8.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/3831cc6d92e2e39dad87b419cb221cc8.webp?t=1755615032\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=69 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are given two pairs of pentominoes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/d64d5e6f79b766e36e6ce2abcda89c4e.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/d64d5e6f79b766e36e6ce2abcda89c4e.webp?t=1755615032\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=199 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine them into two shapes that have the same outline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/7d43c5d674833c6fdde883dfec6efbb6.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" width=780 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/7d43c5d674833c6fdde883dfec6efbb6.webm?t=1755615032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">For an extra challenge, there's an option to hide the outline until you find it</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/3831cc6d92e2e39dad87b419cb221cc8.poster.avif?t=1755615032\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3455870/extras/3831cc6d92e2e39dad87b419cb221cc8.webp?t=1755615032\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=69 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>",
